/* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *

Connection Requests:

con     connect
dis     disconnect

Tenant Requests:

mkten   create_tenant
lsten   list_tenants
rmten   drop_tenant

Catalog Requests:

mkcat   create_catalog
lscat   list_catalogs
rmcat   drop_catalog

Schema Requests:

mksch   create_schema
lssch   list_schemas
rmsch   drop_schema
usesch  use_schema

Table Requests:

antbl   analyze_table
gettbl  get_table
mktbl   create_table
lstbl   list_tables
add     add_column
lscol   list_columns
ld      load_table
tblInUse  table_inuse
sel     select_table
dump    dump_table
cp      copy_table
dex     dist_export_table
ex      export_table
sz      size_table
tr      truncate_table
rettbl  return_table
rmtbl   drop_table

Dictionary Requests:

cf      cf ..
cf ~
cf
pwf     pwf
lf      lf

Misc Requests:

seitf   seitf_count
mon     get_monitor
ping    ping
x       x

Grid Request:
lfG     lf on grid
pRB     print a row buffer on each node

* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * */

